#, no-wrap
msgid "See the [API reference documentation](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/functions/index) for Qiskit Functions.\n"
msgstr "Consulta la [documentazione di riferimento API](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/functions/index) per le Qiskit Functions.\n"

